=1 855 10
+    This routine loads and invokes a program. FwExecute sets the firmware
+    stack and calls this routine which does all the work. When this routine
+    returns (after the loaded program has been executed) the stack is restored
+    to the caller's and control is returned to it.
=1 257 3
+    ESUCCESS is returned if the program was loaded and invoked; otherwise the
+    status of the failure.
=1 263 4
=1 893 1
+    ULONG TransferRoutine;
